ags as an image. You don’t need to use the words `image`, `photo,` or `picture` (or any specified custom words) in the alt prop.","jsx-a11y/role-has-required-aria-props","Elements with the ARIA role \"combobox\" must have the following attributes defined: aria-controls,aria-expanded","JSXAttribute"]